    "result_text": "Confirmed \u2014 `AcceptanceTest` is the only test class (the other two files are `AcceptanceBase` and a helper). The full suite is green.\n\n## Summary\n\nImplemented `contactPreference` = `EMAIL` when an email is present, otherwise `PHONE`, following the existing computed-field pattern (`locality`/`membershipLevel`).\n\nThree changes:\n\n1. **`rest/function/owner/ContactPreference.java`** (new) \u2014 helper mirroring `Locality`/`MembershipLevel`. `of(Owner)` returns `\"EMAIL\"` for a non-null, non-blank email, else `\"PHONE\"` (treating blank as no email, consistent with `MembershipLevel`).\n\n2. **`mapper/OwnerMapper.java`** \u2014 added a `@Mapping` for `contactPreference` delegating to the helper, wrapped in `OwnerDto.ContactPreferenceEnum.fromValue(...)` since the schema property is a typed enum.\n\n3. **`resources/openapi.yml`** \u2014 added a read-only `contactPreference` string property (enum `EMAIL`/`PHONE`) to the `Owner` schema so the generated DTO exposes the field.\n\nTest results: `AcceptanceTest` (both `corePhoneWhenNoEmail` and `functionalityEmailWhenPresent`) and the full `mvn test` \u2014 **BUILD SUCCESS**, 0 failures.",
